WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.724 --> 00:00:02.626
(machine ticking)

00:00:02.626 --> 00:00:03.948
- [Man] If the oceans die,

00:00:03.948 --> 00:00:04.781
we die.

00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:06.457
- [Man] The land is small, you know,

00:00:06.457 --> 00:00:08.428
it's 30 percent of this whole planet.

00:00:08.428 --> 00:00:09.491
The open ocean

00:00:09.491 --> 00:00:10.995
is a lawless area.

00:00:10.995 --> 00:00:12.583
The UN is just starting

00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:13.811
to address that now.

00:00:13.811 --> 00:00:15.492
- [Man] So Sea Shepard steps in

00:00:15.492 --> 00:00:17.659
in accordance with the United Nations

00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:19.280
World Charter for Nature.

00:00:19.280 --> 00:00:20.974
- [Man] It's not just a protest,

00:00:20.974 --> 00:00:23.208
it's getting physically involved

00:00:23.208 --> 00:00:25.350
and making a difference.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.235
- [Man] There's not
many organizations left

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:28.730
that do what they do

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:31.457
and go thousands of
miles, you know, trying to protect

00:00:31.457 --> 00:00:33.134
the marine life in the waters.

00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:35.551
(slow music)

